WEBVTT

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:34.016
Princess Ayeka has managed
to pass through our checkpoint

00:01:34.016 --> 00:01:36.552
and enter into Jurai territory.

00:01:36.552 --> 00:01:40.422
His Majesty Yosho is most
upset about this failure in defense.

00:01:40.422 --> 00:01:43.125
Update us with the current status, Admiral.

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.490
Yes.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.362
As you can see,

00:01:46.362 --> 00:01:52.368
my armada is deployed to cover the entire
Jurai planetary system in search of her.

00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:56.464
It is only a matter of time
until we capture Princess Ayeka.

00:02:06.482 --> 00:02:09.251
Finally, we are in Jurai territory.

00:02:09.251 --> 00:02:13.489
Yes. You know, I can't believe
we managed to make it this far.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:17.226
Yeah, with all the things that
happened during our journey.

00:02:17.226 --> 00:02:18.794
Indeed.

00:02:18.794 --> 00:02:23.365
I just hope our luck will hold out
until we can prove our innocence.

00:02:23.365 --> 00:02:25.501
So do I, Tenchi.

00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:29.071
Then you can return to the Jurai royal family,

00:02:29.071 --> 00:02:31.938
and the rest of us can
finally go home to planet Earth.

00:02:38.514 --> 00:02:41.016
What is it, Ayeka? Is anything wrong?

00:02:41.016 --> 00:02:45.316
No, there's nothing wrong.

00:02:47.056 --> 00:02:50.492
Thanks, Mihoshi. It's my
turn to take the shift now.

00:02:52.327 --> 00:02:56.696
Just how many hours a
day does she need to sleep?

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.660
Oh, no!

00:03:08.077 --> 00:03:11.313
That's a confirmation, Sir!
That ship is Yagami!

00:03:11.313 --> 00:03:13.649
Very good! Commence attack immediately!

00:03:13.649 --> 00:03:15.276
We cannot let them escape!

00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:22.091
Ohh! I'm really sorry!

00:03:22.091 --> 00:03:25.788
You're sorry?! Just how long
a nap did you take this time?!

00:03:27.029 --> 00:03:28.664
It's no use! We can't shake them!

00:03:28.664 --> 00:03:29.631
We've got to!

00:03:29.631 --> 00:03:31.333
There must be a way, Kiyone!

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:34.436
There's a cluster of stars
at 25 degrees starboard.

00:03:34.436 --> 00:03:37.337
We need to head our ship to the center of it.

00:03:38.607 --> 00:03:40.375
What do you mean, Grandpa?

00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:42.811
Hurry up now, or they'll catch up with us.

00:03:42.811 --> 00:03:46.648
I don't think so. I have no data on it.

00:03:46.648 --> 00:03:50.085
You see?! Nothing shows
up on the space map.

00:03:50.085 --> 00:03:51.353
The sacred place!

00:03:51.353 --> 00:03:54.389
Heh? Oh, no, it can't be!

00:03:54.389 --> 00:03:55.724
The sacred place of Jurai?!

00:03:55.724 --> 00:03:56.925
The sacred place...

00:03:56.925 --> 00:03:57.726
...of Jurai?

00:03:57.726 --> 00:03:59.695
What on earth is it, anyway?

00:03:59.695 --> 00:04:05.000
The sacred place is the forbidden space in
Jurai territory where no one is allowed to enter.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.035
Hey, that's perfect. I say let's go!

00:04:07.035 --> 00:04:10.172
No way! It's a forbidden place,
Ryoko! We can't go in there!

00:04:10.172 --> 00:04:12.402
We can't worry about that now!

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.968
Come on! Hurry!

00:04:19.214 --> 00:04:20.983
The target has changed course.

00:04:20.983 --> 00:04:23.118
We'll be breaking into the
sacred place, if we follow them!

00:04:23.118 --> 00:04:24.319
What?!

00:04:24.319 --> 00:04:26.789
Shall we pursue them, Sir?!

00:04:26.789 --> 00:04:28.423
No. We can't do that!

00:04:28.423 --> 00:04:31.226
We have to contact Jurai
headquarters to get permission first!

00:04:31.226 --> 00:04:33.128
Yes, Sir!

00:04:33.128 --> 00:04:35.323
And we were so close to catching them...

00:04:46.575 --> 00:04:48.177
This is the sacred place.

00:04:48.177 --> 00:04:50.202
Looks like they're not following us.

00:04:51.313 --> 00:04:52.748
Good work, Kiyone.

00:04:52.748 --> 00:04:55.384
Now adjust our course
about seven degrees down.

00:04:55.384 --> 00:04:57.820
We should see a planet ahead of us, I think.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.388
Grandpa...

00:04:59.388 --> 00:05:02.558
Ah, I'm tired, and we'll get some rest there.

00:05:02.558 --> 00:05:05.391
Old bones get tired easily, you know.

00:05:11.733 --> 00:05:14.570
Lord Katsuhito, are we truly heading for...

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:19.374
I thought we probably should
have your originals join our force.

00:05:19.374 --> 00:05:23.645
So I am taking your lives
in custody, if you don't mind.

00:05:23.645 --> 00:05:26.415
Who are you really?

00:05:26.415 --> 00:05:28.951
I am the one you think I am.

00:05:28.951 --> 00:05:31.220
Grandpa!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.989
Grandpa, how come you
know all these things anyway?

00:05:33.989 --> 00:05:37.459
About the cluster of stars
and the sacred place of Jurai?

00:05:37.459 --> 00:05:39.791
How do you know, Grandpa?

00:05:42.464 --> 00:05:49.338
I'll tell you, Tenchi there are things I was
hoping you would never need to know,

00:05:49.338 --> 00:05:54.009
but it just may be your
destiny to know them after all.

00:05:54.009 --> 00:05:55.377
Huh?

00:05:55.377 --> 00:06:00.115
Listen, Tenchi, whatever happens from
now on you stand firm and face your destiny

00:06:00.115 --> 00:06:03.085
without fear, but with courage.

00:06:03.085 --> 00:06:05.287
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:06:05.287 --> 00:06:08.916
You will know, and soon, Tenchi.

00:06:16.398 --> 00:06:18.229
Grandpa...

00:06:21.003 --> 00:06:25.440
I wonder if that's the planet where
they say the two knights are sealed in?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.776
The two knights, Ayeka?

00:06:27.776 --> 00:06:30.045
Yes.

00:06:30.045 --> 00:06:33.415
It's one of the legends
handed down in Jurai royal family.

00:06:33.415 --> 00:06:40.378
A long, long time ago, there were two
knights who fought to protect the king of Jurai.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:55.704
The two knights had great
strength hidden within them.

00:06:55.704 --> 00:06:58.707
Such great strength, it is
said they could shatter stars.

00:06:58.707 --> 00:07:01.642
When the battle was over, they
put themselves into a long sleep.

00:07:05.781 --> 00:07:11.386
The legend has it that, when
Jurai's royal family is in danger,

00:07:11.386 --> 00:07:14.690
they will rise once again to fight
alongside the current Jurai king.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:16.180
Oh...

00:07:21.363 --> 00:07:24.099
Okay, so how much
farther do we have to go?

00:07:24.099 --> 00:07:26.201
We're almost there now.

00:07:26.201 --> 00:07:29.538
What is it you're looking
for at the end of this road?

00:07:29.538 --> 00:07:31.239
The hands that will help.

00:07:31.239 --> 00:07:32.708
Hmm?

00:07:32.708 --> 00:07:37.045
On our own, we are not powerful
enough to enter the Jurai palace,

00:07:37.045 --> 00:07:42.483
so it is necessary for us to get
some help: The most powerful help of all.

00:07:55.831 --> 00:07:59.892
The helping hands I'm
counting on are over there. Look.

00:08:06.975 --> 00:08:09.578
Even I get the creeps in this place. It's spooky.

00:08:09.578 --> 00:08:13.139
It sure is. I'm scared.

00:09:09.938 --> 00:09:11.599
Look!

00:09:17.112 --> 00:09:19.808
Wait a minute. Are they...

00:09:22.784 --> 00:09:24.086
Hmm.

00:09:24.086 --> 00:09:26.421
I see.

00:09:26.421 --> 00:09:28.582
I knew it.

00:09:29.424 --> 00:09:32.325
Grandfather, tell me, who are you really?

00:09:35.897 --> 00:09:37.499
Are you two ready now?

00:09:37.499 --> 00:09:39.228
- Yes, Sir!
- Yes, Sir!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.712
Very well. Let's proceed.

00:10:32.821 --> 00:10:34.311
It's...

00:10:37.726 --> 00:10:39.591
It is Jurai's power!

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:36.244
Azaka and Kamidake have been resurrected.

00:12:36.244 --> 00:12:38.480
I see now that our
guardians were programmed,

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.516
with the personalities of these two knights;

00:12:41.516 --> 00:12:47.352
the two knights loyal to Jurai's
royal family: Azaka and Kamidake.

00:12:56.564 --> 00:12:59.634
My lord, we have risen
from the sleep of Hades...

00:12:59.634 --> 00:13:02.865
...our lord, the king of Jurai.

00:13:22.624 --> 00:13:25.994
Now don't misunderstand me.
I am not the king of Jurai.

00:13:25.994 --> 00:13:31.499
Such a thing is not our concern, for we
know that without the righteous Jurai power

00:13:31.499 --> 00:13:32.634
it would have been impossible to awaken us.

00:13:32.634 --> 00:13:36.971
I recognize the power you possess
is no less than that of King Jurai I,

00:13:36.971 --> 00:13:39.207
and we will serve you.

00:13:39.207 --> 00:13:41.443
It is true I am not the Jurai king.

00:13:41.443 --> 00:13:47.148
However, I admit that I am a lineal
descendant of the Jurai royal family.

00:13:47.148 --> 00:13:48.979
Grandpa!

00:13:51.119 --> 00:13:57.319
My name is Yosho, and I once
abandoned the Jurai royal family.

00:14:01.096 --> 00:14:02.564
Incoming communication
from the armada, Sir!

00:14:02.564 --> 00:14:04.799
Put it on the screen!

00:14:04.799 --> 00:14:08.636
The council has given its permission.
Resume pursuit immediately!

00:14:08.636 --> 00:14:09.738
Yes, Sir!

00:14:09.738 --> 00:14:15.043
Use any means necessary to immobilize
Princess Ayeka until the armada arrives!

00:14:15.043 --> 00:14:16.244
Understood?

00:14:16.244 --> 00:14:18.235
I understand, Sir!

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:32.858
One day, after a long and wandering
journey I arrived on planet Earth.

00:14:34.496 --> 00:14:40.196
I was alone and grief-stricken.
The Earth seemed a gentle place to my eyes.

00:14:42.804 --> 00:14:46.408
Devout people in the far reach of the universe.

00:14:46.408 --> 00:14:51.012
I decided to remain on planet
Earth until the end of my days.

00:14:51.012 --> 00:14:54.682
I met my wife and,
through marriage with her

00:14:54.682 --> 00:14:57.452
I became the son-in-law of
the keeper of the Masaki Shrine.

00:14:57.452 --> 00:15:01.489
It was then that I was given
the name Katsuhito Masaki.

00:15:01.489 --> 00:15:07.429
Of course I immediately recognized it
was Washu sealed in the Masaki Shrine.

00:15:07.429 --> 00:15:10.999
I was surprised to find
the legendary mad scientist

00:15:10.999 --> 00:15:14.628
had drifted ashore on such a remote planet.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.775
Hey, this is the first time
I've ever heard all this!

00:15:20.775 --> 00:15:24.612
Why didn't you tell me this story
when I married your daughter?!

00:15:24.612 --> 00:15:29.451
You mean I should have told you
I was from outer space? Now, really!

00:15:29.451 --> 00:15:31.486
That means I...

00:15:31.486 --> 00:15:35.457
That's right. You're a lineal
descendant of the Jurai royal family.

00:15:35.457 --> 00:15:37.225
Really?!

00:15:37.225 --> 00:15:40.786
Tenchi... is a descendant of Jurai.

00:15:41.463 --> 00:15:45.366
And that makes the
Yosho of planet Jurai a fake.

00:15:45.366 --> 00:15:49.871
Yeah, but he's gotta be connected to
Jurai's royal family in some way, I bet.

00:15:49.871 --> 00:15:52.440
Katsuhito... no. Lord Yosho!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.775
You're quite something

00:15:53.775 --> 00:15:59.113
to have been able to hide the Jurai power
you possess from my eyes all this time.

00:15:59.113 --> 00:16:01.950
But you don't have to hide anything anymore!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:05.253
You have an idea about the true
identity of the enemy, don't you?

00:16:05.253 --> 00:16:06.743
Mmm...

00:16:10.992 --> 00:16:12.391
Oh, no! They're here!

00:16:16.197 --> 00:16:17.165
Stay where you are.

00:16:17.165 --> 00:16:18.833
It is impossible for you to escape!

00:16:18.833 --> 00:16:20.668
Oh, my! Hurry! We've got to run!

00:16:20.668 --> 00:16:22.670
Yeah, but run where?!

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.365
Ryo-Ohki!

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.449
- Oh, no! Ryo-Ohki?!
- How dare you?!

00:16:34.449 --> 00:16:36.284
All right! We've restrained Ryo-Ohki!

00:16:36.284 --> 00:16:37.519
Prepare to attack!

00:16:37.519 --> 00:16:39.009
Yes, Sir!

00:16:41.856 --> 00:16:43.691
Let us deal with them!

00:16:43.691 --> 00:16:46.091
You don't need to worry now.

00:16:49.264 --> 00:16:50.398
Yeah!

00:16:50.398 --> 00:16:53.268
Let's go, Kamidake. We need some exercise.

00:16:53.268 --> 00:16:54.369
Oh, yeah!

00:16:54.369 --> 00:16:56.166
Fire!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.710
W-Wow!

00:17:14.989 --> 00:17:17.859
Are you all right, Ryo-Ohki?!

00:17:17.859 --> 00:17:20.953
Well, that was quite easy, actually.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.496
Princess, you're not hurt, are you?

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.132
I'm okay... thank you.

00:17:50.491 --> 00:17:53.551
They... aren't dead, are they?

00:17:57.065 --> 00:18:03.071
They have discharged all their energy
in order to resurrect the two knights.

00:18:03.071 --> 00:18:07.342
You have served well
for so long on our behalf.

00:18:07.342 --> 00:18:09.310
I thank you.

00:18:10.578 --> 00:18:16.141
And now we will take over your
work and you may rest in peace.

00:18:16.951 --> 00:18:19.287
I thank you...

00:18:19.287 --> 00:18:21.589
Azaka...

00:18:21.589 --> 00:18:23.658
Kamidake.

00:18:23.658 --> 00:18:27.560
Now you can rest.

00:18:38.272 --> 00:18:40.174
I am Azaka, a knight of Jurai.

00:18:40.174 --> 00:18:42.310
And I am Kamidake.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:46.714
From now on, we pledge our allegiance to you.

00:18:46.714 --> 00:18:48.249
We can see it clearly.

00:18:48.249 --> 00:18:52.253
We know the one who will
carry on the noble cause.

00:18:52.253 --> 00:18:55.313
Indeed and I'm counting on you.

00:19:03.231 --> 00:19:07.168
So... they lost them in the sealed land.

00:19:07.168 --> 00:19:07.835
Yes, Sir.

00:19:07.835 --> 00:19:10.471
I understand. You may go.

00:19:10.471 --> 00:19:11.961
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:37.732
The seal of the two knights can
only be broken by the Jurai king.

00:19:37.732 --> 00:19:41.469
Yes... he has finally returned.

00:19:41.469 --> 00:19:45.906
I look forward to meeting
you in person... Yosho.

00:19:54.949 --> 00:19:56.384
Now, really!

00:19:56.384 --> 00:20:01.055
How many hours of sleep a
day can she possibly need?!

00:20:01.055 --> 00:20:02.323
There! Take this!

00:20:02.323 --> 00:20:04.120
You can't beat me!

00:20:05.226 --> 00:20:07.361
Yay!

00:20:07.361 --> 00:20:09.397
You beat me again, Princess.

00:20:09.397 --> 00:20:11.763
Practice, Azaka.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:15.303
I lose face every time I play this game!

00:20:15.303 --> 00:20:18.606
Well, we didn't have toys like this in our day.

00:20:18.606 --> 00:20:20.308
Princess! One more time!

00:20:20.308 --> 00:20:23.611
Please allow me to try one
more time, Your Highness!

00:20:23.611 --> 00:20:25.079
Okay!

00:20:25.079 --> 00:20:29.948
Tenchi is a descendant
of the Jurai royal family.

00:22:53.694 --> 00:22:56.697
The legendary warrior Yosho
turns out to be my own grandpa.

00:22:56.697 --> 00:22:59.133
But then who's the man dominating
the royal palace as Jurai emperor

00:22:59.133 --> 00:23:01.168
claiming himself to be Yosho?

00:23:01.168 --> 00:23:04.171
What happened between
him and grandpa in the past?

00:23:04.171 --> 00:23:06.774
We'll see the missing pieces
of the puzzle fall into place.

00:23:06.774 --> 00:23:08.976
It is time for Grandpa to face the
false emperor at the old royal palace

00:23:08.976 --> 00:23:11.712
where it all began eons ago.

00:23:11.712 --> 00:23:16.217
The two most powerful men in the
universe meet again in the final duel.

00:23:16.217 --> 00:23:18.252
Next episode is: "No Need for Karma!"

00:23:18.252 --> 00:23:20.686
It's unquestionably fierce.
